{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_35613","headline":"送蕲州裴员外 · 李山甫","name":"送蕲州裴员外","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"正作南宫第一人，蹔随霓斾怆离羣。\n晓从阙下辞天子，春向江头待使君。\n五马尚迷青琐路，双鱼犹惹翠兰芬。\n明朝无路寻归处，禁树参差隔紫云。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李山甫","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_35613.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_35613","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}